WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:06.370
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and as promised
this weeks Game of Thrones video about The

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:10.369
Faceless Men. Because we’re still pre season
5 I’m going to start with a history of their

00:00:10.369 --> 00:00:17.369
religion. They’re a 
religious society that worships the many faced
god and engages in the trade of assassination.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.000
So when you try to join their order you’re
not just learning to kill people, you're learning

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.280
to serve the many faced god.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:33.000
On the show the best look we’ve gotten at
a Faceless Man is Jaquen H’Gar. He’s a

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.480
devout religious assassin, which is why he
speaks in backwards riddles. At the other

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:42.180
end of the Spectrum, you have a common assassin
like Karl, played by Burn Gorman this last

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:47.350
season. He was an assassin in King’s Landing.
I guess you could say he worshipped himself,

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:52.470
but you get the idea. Faceless Men are some
of the most highly trained and feared assassins

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:52.989
in the world.

00:00:52.989 --> 00:00:55.690
Before we get started I just wanted to remind
